        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 🚀 Moss Image Turbo LoRA\n\n**Load one Turbo LoRA here**  \n*(Use only one at a time)*\n\n[**Moss Image Turbo LoRAs** (Civitai)](https://civitai.red/models/3006599/moss-image-turbo-loras?modelVersionId=3414934)\n\n---\n\n### Recommended Settings\n\n| Setting        | Value              |\n|----------------|--------------------|\n| **Steps**      | 4–8                |\n| **CFG**        | `1.0`              |\n| **Sampler**    | Euler              |\n| **Shift**      | `5`                |\n| **Strength**   | `1.0`              |\n\n- **4-step** → up to ~1024² (use 6–8 steps for higher res)\n- **8-step** (incl. DMD2) → most reliable\n- Keep unmerged for best quality\n\n---\n*Adjust settings if you get haze, blur, or reduced face variance.*"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## 🚀 Moss Image Turbo LoRA\n\n**Load one Turbo LoRA here**  \n*(Use only one at a time)*\n\n[**Moss Image Turbo LoRAs** (Civitai)](https://civitai.red/models/3006599/moss-image-turbo-loras?modelVersionId=3414934)\n\n---\n\n### Recommended Settings\n\n| Setting        | Value              |\n|----------------|--------------------|\n| **Steps**      | 4–8                |\n| **CFG**        | `1.0`              |\n| **Sampler**    | Euler              |\n| **Shift**      | `5`                |\n| **Strength**   | `1.0`              |\n\n- **4-step** → up to ~1024² (use 6–8 steps for higher res)\n- **8-step** (incl. DMD2) → most reliable\n- Keep unmerged for best quality\n\n---\n*Adjust settings if you get haze, blur, or reduced face variance.*"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
